"name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","review_id":"btfTSjpNsS2n9PhzOFDGgw","date":"2016-04-01T14:22:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9188476800918579,"text_excerpt":"We always go to a Waffle House when we are traveling and I must say this is the best one I have been in. Good service and food. Nice and family atmosphere. I absolutely recommend this place for a morning breakfast!"},{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","review_id":"VQgd0_pl8wHdiYHs3XrJ_Q","date":"2016-05-13T14:43:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9129835963249207,"text_excerpt":"I'm a fan of the Waffle House in that it is reliable and dependable when you are in a strange city and want to play it safe. The staff are your usual WH lot - smiley pleasant and efficient although there was a delay with the pecan waffle as the cook had to be reminded that it was required. A homeless/beggar type came in and tried to blag a meal, some change or such which is always awkward and some woman tried to walk out after 'forgetting' to pay. It is the kind of area it is. However, I'd go back if I was in the area. It is by the books WH and I like that."},{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","review_id":"MNRA0ygnemIlqtJJ4ZsSrg","date":"2012-12-06T18:17:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9062246084213257,"text_excerpt":"Great place for breakfast super cute girl works the counter on third shift. ;) Love ma Waffle House!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","photo_id":"PJZcVhjHEGRUZ7dUiVUN5A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PJZcVhjHEGRUZ7dUiVUN5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9400450587272644},{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","photo_id":"OCAvkzU-658D7clQA5-41Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OCAvkzU-658D7clQA5-41Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8818255662918091},{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","photo_id":"xpKlwo0t2K-Nq_yJjeqHoQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xpKlwo0t2K-Nq_yJjeqHoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8251504898071289},{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","photo_id":"Jm4Qm7hApHYmgTUAdOh9DA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Jm4Qm7hApHYmgTUAdOh9DA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8236759901046753},{"business_id":"xv1jrIOGNx99gIGPv1yOcw","photo_id":"QbYPj4SoX1a9hrBzqVazOw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QbYPj4SoX1a9hrBzqVazOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7602363228797913}]},"notebook_case":null}
